{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12104230","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12104230","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:3:1210423001:1":{"text":"哦豁，我的两位恩人，别打啦！都是误会！","source_cn":"哦豁，我的两位恩人，别打啦！都是误会！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF1BE02FBFB2259A9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1210423002:1":{"text":"他们是水鬼，你不能让他们进来。尤其是这里。","source_cn":"他们是水鬼，你不能让他们进来。尤其是这里。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x53D9347AF9C95712","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1210423003:1":{"text":"我只知道<male>他</male><female>她</female>是魔法师！","source_cn":"我只知道<male>他</male><female>她...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xAEE70BB62DB2FB8A","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"我只知道<male>他</male><female>她</female>是魔法师！","female":"我只知道<male>他</male><female>她</female>是魔法师！","variant_male_record_index":"128182","variant_female_record_index":"128183","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1210423004:1":{"text":"魔法师又怎样，他们也可能是水鬼帮的人。","source_cn":"魔法师又怎样，他们也可能是水鬼帮的人。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x2885609745A10F92","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"魔法师又怎样，他们也可能是水鬼帮的人。","female":"魔法师又怎样，他们也可能是水鬼帮的人。","variant_male_record_index":"128184","variant_female_record_index":"128185","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1210423005:1":{"text":"不会有错的。他们刚才帮我升级了小金箭，它现在能一发就让亡灵魂体震荡！","source_cn":"不会有错的。他们刚才帮我升级了小金箭，它现在能一发就让...","stat